=== MODIFICATIONS ===

Files imported from Open Science (commit d8f11e34) are MODIFIED per
Apache-2.0 §4. Modifications include:

- Rebranding: Lumen Science Desktop namespacing and brand assets
- Authority removal: all agent-framework execution paths disconnected;
  Rust Lumen SessionActor wired via ACP bridge
- Connector catalog: UI reused; Rust adapters remain authoritative
- Notebook executor: TypeScript executor replaced with Rust KernelAdapter
- Reviewer: correction proposal routed through SessionActor; verdicts
  enter EvidenceGraph
- Persistence: Electron local state limited to UI layout/session/draft;
  science state owned by Rust ProjectStore/ArtifactRegistry/EvidenceGraph

